nt"},{"id":"lizang-q-a368ff94eedc265d60f6","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-5454cf0e6fc0ead84a33","layer":"original","quote":"诣猛门，衷匕首〖5〗，欲因见以杀猛。猛知其义士，敕遣不杀","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":223,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":88,"end":116,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-a727765f66ff53578f8a","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-4154363130a2175aece5","layer":"pei","quote":"武威太守张猛，假丰为都尉，使赍檄告酒泉：听丰为揖报仇","attribution":"裴注·魏略《勇侠传》","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":279,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-48d5c144befb35f43c2d","start":189,"end":215,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-a8ccd5341c6cd9632265","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-3c8a1af669878a6576f9","layer":"pei","quote":"后商欲逃，事觉，遂杀之。是岁建安十四年也","attribution":"裴注·典略","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":246,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0686fc8691bad454db46","start":275,"end":295,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-ad55fdb2cef9e4d4a294","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-3c8a1af669878a6576f9","layer":"pei","quote":"至十五年，将军韩遂，自上讨猛，猛发兵遣军东拒","attribution":"裴注·典略","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":246,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0686fc8691bad454db46","start":296,"end":318,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-b36cd4ef2690582dd05f","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-3c8a1af669878a6576f9","layer":"pei","quote":"及猛被攻，自知必死，曰：‘使死者无知则已矣；若有知，岂使吾头东过华阴历先君之墓乎？’乃登楼自烧而死","attribution":"裴注·典略","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":246,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0686fc8691bad454db46","start":391,"end":440,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-d07e02dae7e8ddb8bccf","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-3c8a1af669878a6576f9","layer":"pei","quote":"其吏民畏遂，乃反共攻猛","attribution":"裴注·典略","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":246,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0686fc8691bad454db46","start":319,"end":330,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-dc1d26e48172db0ba4bb","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-5454cf0e6fc0ead84a33","layer":"original","quote":"淯闻之，弃官，昼夜奔走；号哭丧所，讫","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":223,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":66,"end":84,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-ec7306f0033e297f3403","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-3c8a1af669878a6576f9","layer":"pei","quote":"猛觉之，遂勒兵攻商","attribution":"裴注·典略","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":246,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0686fc8691bad454db46","start":171,"end":180,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-efcac471dc7222d51623","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-4154363130a2175aece5","layer":"pei","quote":"丰谓昂曰：‘卿前欲生系我颈，今反为我所系，云何？’昂惭谢，丰遂杀之","attribution":"裴注·魏略《勇侠传》","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":279,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-48d5c144befb35f43c2d","start":298,"end":331,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-f22511299bc9a09642a7","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-3c8a1af669878a6576f9","layer":"pei","quote":"暨到，商欲诛猛","attribution":"裴注·典略","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":246,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0686fc8691bad454db46","start":163,"end":170,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q2-99a74403d6ab7dbeb069","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-3c8a1af669878a6576f9","layer":"pei","quote":"《典略》曰：“张猛字叔威，本敦煌人也。猛父奂，桓帝时，仕历郡守、中郎将、太常，遂居华阴，终因葬焉。建安初，猛仕郡，为功曹。是时河西四郡以去凉州治远，隔以河寇，上书求别置州。诏以陈留人邯郸商，为雍州刺史，别典四郡。时武威太守缺，诏又以猛父昔在河西有威名，乃以猛补之。商、猛俱西。初，猛与商同岁，每相戏侮；及共之官，行道更相责望。暨到，商欲诛猛；猛觉之，遂勒兵攻商。商治舍与猛侧近，商闻兵至，恐怖登屋，呼猛字曰：‘叔威，汝欲杀我耶？然我死者有知，汝亦族矣！请和解，尚可乎？’猛因呼曰：‘来！’商逾屋就猛，猛因责数之；语毕，以商属督邮。督邮录商，闭置传舍。后商欲逃，事觉，遂杀之。是岁建安十四年也。至十五年，将军韩遂，自上讨猛，猛发兵遣军东拒。其吏民畏遂，乃反共攻猛。初奂为武威太守时，猛方在孕。母梦带奂印绶，登楼而歌；旦以告奂。奂讯占梦者，曰：‘夫人方生男。后当复临此郡，其必死官乎！’及猛被攻，自知必死，曰：‘使死者无知则已矣；若有知，岂使吾头东过华阴历先君之墓乎？’乃登楼自烧而死。”","attribution":"裴注·典略","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":246,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0686fc8691bad454db46","start":0,"end":442,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
